    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive cyber-defense art direction: disciplined cyan/red accents, clear ALLOW/BLOCK contrast, consistent panels, and polished controls. Desktop hierarchy is excellent. Tablet and mobile remain orderly, but the dense mono microcopy becomes uncomfortably small, the mobile card is extremely long, and the header loses the brand identity while exposing only a cryptic nav slice. Tablet/mobile header contrast also lacks conclusive proof.",
